@CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118
@token = paste-jwt-token-here

### List universities
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get an existing university
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a university that does not exist (404)
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a university (201)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pamukkale Üniversitesi",
  "city": "Denizli"
}

### Create a duplicate university (409)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pamukkale Üniversitesi",
  "city": "Denizli"
}

### Create with invalid data (400)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "city": "Denizli"
}

### Update a university (204)
PUT {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pamukkale Üniversitesi",
  "city": "Denizli"
}

### Delete a university (204)
DELETE {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Universities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List courses
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List courses for one university
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses?universityId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a course by ID (404 if missing)
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a course (201)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Veri Yapıları",
  "code": " blg202 ",
  "universityId": 1
}

### Create a course with a duplicate code (409)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Veri Yapıları",
  "code": "BLG202",
  "universityId": 1
}

### Create a course with a missing university (400)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Veri Yapıları",
  "code": "BLG202",
  "universityId": 999999
}

### Update a course (204; university cannot be changed)
PUT {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Güncellenmiş Veri Yapıları",
  "code": " BLG203 "
}

### Upload an educational resource (replace the sample text with desired metadata)
POST {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CheckPointBoundary

--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

Veri Yapıları ders notları
--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Örnek metin dosyası
--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="UniversityId"

1
--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="CourseId"

1
--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Type"

LectureNote
--CheckPointBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Bu dosya eğitim kaynağı yükleme endpoint'ini test etmek için kullanılır.
--CheckPointBoundary--

### List resources with filters and pagination
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources?universityId=1&courseId=1&type=LectureNote&q=not&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get resource details (404 if missing)
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Download a resource file (404 if the file is missing)
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources/1/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update resource metadata (owner or Admin)
PUT {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Güncellenmiş ders notları",
  "description": "Güncellenmiş açıklama",
  "type": "LectureNote"
}

### Delete resource (owner or Admin)
DELETE {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/resources/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List resources uploaded by the current user
GET {{CheckPoint.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/resources?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
